# ─── Homarr secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Encrypts integration API keys (Sonarr, Radarr, qBittorrent, Jellyfin, …)
# stored in Homarr's database. 64 hex characters; setup.sh generates it on
# first run. CHANGING IT INVALIDATES every integration secret already stored —
# back it up with the rest of DATA_PATH.
SECRET_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
